  "replay": "Each case starts fresh: x=0 forward or n backward, marked lane, blank cells. Step by current direction; at interior scatter by the addressed row. At a hub continue unmarked to the opposite port without changing direction; stop at first marked arrival. TIME requires that arrival at exactly n^2; FULL additionally requires initial direction and zero memory. Stop each table at its first failed case. Split only a row first needed by this execution, in output order 0..7. At rejection count 8^free completions; final winning cubes keep all unvisited rows free. Use --replay-id ID to recover the first failed case of any of the complete tables.",
